recommend keep-going ALES24 can offer the choice of law where a crossfade meets a selected edit, splice a selection onto a second point (a marked copy or move), or carry a selection across the ALES0 audio wire as its own framed payload — all agent-doable, no custody gate. The audio-interface hardware write stays a paused research round, taken only on Keaton's word.
